(functional-req (id "79bbd537304c") (version "1.0.0") (status 'implemented)
  (for      "d93037cecb98")
  (title    "Signed authority ships as building, tested code")
  (priority 'high)
  (description
    "The signed-authority implementation shall build clean and pass its full
     test suite in the shipped package. This exists so that the suite-level
     acceptance test has a requirement to attach to: the graph model links an
     acceptance-test to a functional-req, never directly to a feature, because
     a test with no requirement behind it asserts nothing in particular."))
